ag.log: parse ts, track prev; gap = t - prev_t; track\n  max gap + its start/end stamps. Report: max_gap_s, from, to.\n- Also count gaps > 600s (the tool-timeout ceiling) -- those are\n  hang-class candidates.\n- Keep it per-agent (aria/continuo separately) -- the asymmetry\n  finding was per-cycle but per-agent is the aggregation unit the\n  script already speaks.\n- Baseline discipline: W37 is baseline; W38 gets the first silence\n  column; trend claims wait for W39.\n\n[EXTERNAL DATA]: none.\n\n[t+01:44/30:00 c21/120]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_nite7whl","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && ls tasks/iar/aria/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"=== relay items ===\"; find tasks/ -name \"*relay*\" -o -name \"*000*\" 2>/dev/null | head; echo \"=== check relay queue ===\"; ls tasks/iar/aria/relay* 2>/dev/null; find tasks -type d | head -20"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[04:07:08] ROADMAP.org\nrelay-slice-2-migration.org\n=== relay items ===\ntasks/iar/aria/relay-slice-2-migration.org\ntasks/iar/agora-v2-relay\n=== check relay queue ===\ntasks/iar/aria/relay-slice-2-migration.org\ntasks\ntasks/librarian\ntasks/iar\ntasks/iar/frigate\ntasks/iar/frigate/exterior_2-dead-camera\ntasks/iar/restic-stdin-failure\ntasks/iar/aria\ntasks/iar/continuo\ntasks/iar/continuo/interactive-bundle-nacho\ntasks/iar/continuo/continuo\ntasks/iar/agora-v2-relay\ntasks/iar/agora\ntasks/iar/agora/embodiment\ntasks/iar/agora/embodiment/eye-check\ntasks/iar/agora/drills\ntasks/iar/agora/drills/done\ntasks/iar/agora/drills/queue\ntasks/iar/agora/retainers\ntasks/iar/local-brain-benchmark\ntasks/iar/cycle-efficiency-review\n\n[t+01:46/30:00 c22/120]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_o6w3kbyy","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && ls tasks/iar/agora-v2-relay/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"=== queue contents ===\"; for f in tasks/